    "body": "The GUI workflow requires the external NC runner from #2218. That issue remains open.\n\nI checked upstream/main f3b0e195503466db86b0ff0b15dbf614153e1bb4.\nIn crates/app/src/stock_play.rs, PlaySeed has private fields. Its public methods are gather and index.\nThe gather method uses stock_sim::plan_program_until_ungenerated. It cannot accept an external NC program.\n\nI stopped before the claim. No code changed. Implementing #2218 exceeds this one-issue task.\n",
